{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01PD8ayeTc9M6JMEQmTjmokc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AYNSHZBX6RXSQv4yvQFvD2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(dhcpv4): implement data persistence layer per PRD\n\nAdd comprehensive DHCP service data persistence layer with:\n\n- TOML-based pool configuration (PoolConfig module)\n  - Subnet CIDR parsing with mask calculation\n  - Range validation and IP tuple conversion\n  - Static reservation support (MAC → IP)\n  - Configurable max_leases per pool (default 1000)\n\n- ACL rules enforcement (ACL module)\n  - MAC pattern matching with glob support\n  - Vendor class and user class matching\n  - Priority-ordered rule evaluation\n  - Actions: allow, deny, custom_options\n\n- Conflict detection and auto-reassignment (ConflictResolver module)\n  - GenServer for IP conflict management\n  - Quarantine tracking with expiration\n  - Integration with LeaseManager for reassignment\n  - Telemetry events for conflict monitoring\n\n- Custom options with template variables (CustomOptions module)\n  - Type validation: string, ip, ip_list, uint8/16/32, hex\n  - Template substitution: ${client_mac}, ${client_hostname},\n    ${lease_address}, ${pool_name}\n  - Option set merging with scope hierarchy\n  - Binary encoding for DHCP packet generation\n\n- LeaseManager bug fixes\n  - Fixed get_pool_config using Map.get on list (now Enum.find)\n  - Fixed get_static_reservations same issue\n  - Return full pool struct for AddressPool compatibility\n\nIncludes comprehensive test coverage (all 103 DHCPv4 tests pass).\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit PRD implementation"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":822,"cache_read_input_tokens":86382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":822,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context