{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_016eGiJeyrTofXc8P6KADVyR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let me now summarize the PRD implementation work completed in this session.\n\n## Summary\n\nI've completed the DHCP Service Data Persistence PRD implementation for DHCPv4. Here's what was done:\n\n### New Modules Created\n\n1. **`PoolConfig`** - TOML-based pool configuration loading (FR1)\n   - Subnet CIDR parsing with mask calculation\n   - Range validation and IP tuple conversion\n   - Static reservation support (MAC → IP)\n   - Max lease limits per pool (default 1000)\n\n2. **`ACL`** - Access Control List enforcement (FR3)\n   - MAC pattern matching with glob support (`aa:bb:cc:*`)\n   - Vendor class and user class matching\n   - Priority-ordered rule evaluation\n   - Actions: allow, deny, custom_options\n\n3. **`ConflictResolver`** - IP conflict detection and auto-reassignment (FR2.4)\n   - GenServer for IP conflict management\n   - Quarantine tracking with expiration\n   - Automatic reassignment via LeaseManager\n   - Stats tracking and telemetry events\n\n4. **`CustomOptions`** - Custom DHCP options with templates (FR4)\n   - Type validation: string, ip, ip_list, uint8/16/32, hex\n   - Template substitution: `${client_mac}`, `${client_hostname}`, `${lease_address}`, `${pool_name}`\n   - Option set merging with scope hierarchy\n   - Binary encoding for DHCP packet generation\n\n### Handler Integration\n- ACL evaluation in DISCOVER handling\n- ConflictResolver integration in DECLINE handling\n- CustomOptions template substitution in responses\n- ConflictResolver added to supervisor for automatic startup\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- LeaseManager `get_pool_config` and `get_static_reservations` used `Map.get` on a list (fixed to `Enum.find`)\n- `format_mac` now handles 16-byte chaddr field correctly\n\n### Tests\n- 105 DHCPv4 tests pass (103 original + 2 new integration tests)\n- 1314 tests pass across all 11 apps\n\n### Commits\n- `43704f2` - feat(dhcpv4): implement data persistence layer per PRD\n- `80c73c1` - feat(dhcpv4): integrate ACL, ConflictResolver, and CustomOptions with handler\n- `68c77b3` - test(dhcpv4): add integration tests for ConflictResolver with handler\n- `aa1d66b` - chore: format code and update continuity documentation\n- `32bf5be` - feat(dhcpv4): add ConflictResolver to supervisor child list"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":257,"cache_read_input_tokens":144339,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":257,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a8559038-3d53-47df-9b7a-d16bbb068c80","uuid":"a9ac0660-f05a-47c6-8736-bbe2491794ee"}
