{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01WeNyqY2QMVdEGTJfXLShrE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I understand the issue. When zones are created in tests without a `zone_file` configured, and records are added (making them dirty), the `terminate` callback tries to save and logs an error because there's no file path. The fix is to make this a warning-level message (not error) when it's an expected situation (no config)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":91317,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":964,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81e7b7f4-e770-437b-8bdf-216395b89020","uuid":"294c950d-c9e9-4d5e-8ab2-b4aaca78b9d7"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01WeNyqY2QMVdEGTJfXLShrE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PtGvrYW4fnW8S7TfUYMvNt","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/yellow_dog_dns/lib/yellow_dog/dns/zone/auth.ex","old_string":"  @impl true\n  def terminate(reason, state) do\n    # Save zone data on graceful shutdown if dirty\n    if state.dirty do\n      case do_save(state) do\n        :ok ->\n          Telemetry.info(\"Auth zone saved on shutdown\", %{name: state.name})\n\n        {:error, save_reason} ->\n          Telemetry.error(\"Failed to save zone on shutdown\", %{\n            zone: state.name,\n            reason: save_reason\n          })\n      end\n    end","new_string":"  @impl true\n  def terminate(reason, state) do\n    # Save zone data on graceful shutdown if dirty\n    if state.dirty do\n      # Only attempt save if a file path is configured\n      if state.zone_file != nil || state.zone_data_path != nil do\n        case do_save(state) do\n          :ok ->\n            Telemetry.info(\"Auth zone saved on shutdown\", %{name: state.name})\n\n          {:error, save_reason} ->\n            Telemetry.error(\"Failed to save zone on shutdown\", %{\n              zone: state.name,\n              reason: save_reason\n            })\n        end\n      else\n        # No file path configured - this is normal for test zones\n        Telemetry.debug(\"Zone not persisted (no file path configured)\", %{name: state.name})\n      end\n    end"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":964,"cache_read_input_tokens":91317,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":964,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81e7b7f4-e770-437b-8bdf-216395b89020","uuid":"c6915216-bf4d