{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QADdpBoQQ1LyMUGF9DQy8b","type":"tool_result","content":"apps/abyss/README.md-11-- **High Performance**: Supervisor-based architecture with configurable connection pooling\napps/abyss/README.md-12-- **Flexible Handler System**: Pluggable handler modules for custom protocol implementations\napps/abyss/README.md-13-- **Real-time Metrics**: Built-in telemetry with connection counts, throughput rates, and response times\napps/abyss/README.md:14:- **Security Features**: Built-in rate limiting and packet size validation\napps/abyss/README.md-15-- **Broadcast Support**: Native support for broadcast and multicast applications\napps/abyss/README.md-16-- **Graceful Shutdown**: Coordinated shutdown with configurable timeouts\napps/abyss/README.md-17-- **Extensible Transport**: Pluggable transport layer (currently UDP)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-389-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-390-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-391-Abyss (main supervisor)\napps/abyss/README.md:392:├── Abyss.RateLimiter (if enabled)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-393-├── Abyss.ListenerPool (supervisor)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-394-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 1)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-395-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 2)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-4-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-5-## Project Overview\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-6-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:7:Abyss is a pure Elixir UDP server library that provides a modern, high-performance foundation for building UDP-based services like DNS servers, DHCP servers, or custom UDP applications. It implements a supervisor-based architecture with connection pooling, pluggable transport modules, and built-in security features including rate limiting and packet size validation.\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-8-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-9-**Important**: Abyss is part of the Yellow Dog umbrella project and uses shared build paths configured in mix.exs:\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-10-- `build_path: \"../../_build\"`\n--\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-28-- **Listener Pool Scaler**: `Abyss.ListenerPoolScaler` - Dynamic scaling of listener pool based on load\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-29-- **Connection Handling**: `Abyss.Connection` - Handles individual UDP connections/clients via DynamicSupervisor with non-blocking retry logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-30-- **Handler**: `Abyss.Handler` - Behaviour for implementing custom request/response logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:31:- **Rate Limiter**: `Abyss.RateLimiter` - Token bucket rate limiting for DoS protection (GenServer-based)\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-32-- **Telemetry**: `Abyss.Telemetry` - Metrics and monitoring via :telemetry\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-33-- **Logger**: `Abyss.Logger` - Structured logging with different levels\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-34-\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-242-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-243-## Security Features\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-244-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:245:### Rate Limiting\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:246:Abyss includes a token bucket rate limiter (`Abyss.RateLimiter`) for DoS protection:\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:247:- Per-IP rate limiting using token bucket algorithm\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-248-- Configurable packet limits and time windows\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:249:- Automatic cleanup of expired rate limit buckets\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:250:- Telemetry events for rate limit violations\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-251-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-252-### Packet Size Validation\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-253-Incoming packets are validated against `max_packet_size` to prevent memory exhaustion attacks.\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-362-### Supervisor Tree\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-363-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-364-Abyss (main supervisor)\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:365:├── Abyss.RateLimiter (if enabled) - Token bucket rate limiting\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-366-├── Abyss.ListenerPool (supervisor)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-367-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 1)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-368-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 2)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-378-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-379-### Request Flow with Security\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-380-1. **Listener Pool**: Manages multiple listener processes for load distribution\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:381:2. **Listener**: Waits for UDP packets, applies rate limiting and packet size validation\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-382-3. **Connection**: Creates handler processes for valid packets with non-blocking retry logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-383-4. **Handler**: Processes packet data using user-defined logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-384-5. **Transport**: Handles low-level UDP socket operations\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:385:6. **Rate Limiter**: Enforces per-IP rate limits using token bucket algorithm\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-386-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-387-### Broadcast Mode\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-388-When `broadcast: true` is set:\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-418-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-419-## Key Implementation Details\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-420-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:421:### Rate Limiting Algorithm\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:422:The rate limiter uses a token bucket algorithm:\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-423-- Each IP address has a bucket with configurable token capacity\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-424-- Tokens are refilled at a constant rate based on time elapsed\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-425-- Packets consume tokens; requests are rejected when bucket is empty\n--\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-519-2. **Permission denied**: Avoid privileged ports (< 1024) or run with sudo\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-520-3. **Handler crashes**: Check that handler modules implement required callbacks\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-521-4. **Connection limits**: Adjust `num_connections` if hitting max connections\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:522:5. **Rate limiting**: Monitor telemetry events for rate limit violations\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-523-6. **Packet size**: Check `max_packet_size` configuration if packets are rejected\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-524-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-525-### Debugging Commands\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-533-# Check connection supervisor status\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-534-# In IEx: Abyss.Server.connection_sup_pid(pid)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-535-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:536:# Monitor rate limiter statistics\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:537:# In IEx: Abyss.RateLimiter.get_stats()\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-538-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-539-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-540-### Performance Tuning"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81e7b7f4-e770-437b-8bdf-216395b89020","uuid":"911acf0a-afc0-4823-ae9f-f6338f81e8da","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"apps/abyss/README.md-11-- **High Performance**: Supervisor-based architecture with configurable connection pooling\napps/abyss/README.md-12-- **Flexible Handler System**: Pluggable handler modules for custom protocol implementations\napps/abyss/README.md-13-- **Real-time Metrics**: Built-in telemetry with connection counts, throughput rates, and response times\napps/abyss/README.md:14:- **Security Features**: Built-in rate limiting and packet size validation\napps/abyss/README.md-15-- **Broadcast Support**: Native support for broadcast and multicast applications\napps/abyss/README.md-16-- **Graceful Shutdown**: Coordinated shutdown with configurable timeouts\napps/abyss/README.md-17-- **Extensible Transport**: Pluggable transport layer (currently UDP)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-389-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-390-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-391-Abyss (main supervisor)\napps/abyss/README.md:392:├── Abyss.RateLimiter (if enabled)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-393-├── Abyss.ListenerPool (supervisor)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-394-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 1)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/README.md-395-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 2)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-4-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-5-## Project Overview\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-6-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:7:Abyss is a pure Elixir UDP server library that provides a modern, high-performance foundation for building UDP-based services like DNS servers, DHCP servers, or custom UDP applications. It implements a supervisor-based architecture with connection pooling, pluggable transport modules, and built-in security features including rate limiting and packet size validation.\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-8-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-9-**Important**: Abyss is part of the Yellow Dog umbrella project and uses shared build paths configured in mix.exs:\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-10-- `build_path: \"../../_build\"`\n--\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-28-- **Listener Pool Scaler**: `Abyss.ListenerPoolScaler` - Dynamic scaling of listener pool based on load\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-29-- **Connection Handling**: `Abyss.Connection` - Handles individual UDP connections/clients via DynamicSupervisor with non-blocking retry logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-30-- **Handler**: `Abyss.Handler` - Behaviour for implementing custom request/response logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:31:- **Rate Limiter**: `Abyss.RateLimiter` - Token bucket rate limiting for DoS protection (GenServer-based)\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-32-- **Telemetry**: `Abyss.Telemetry` - Metrics and monitoring via :telemetry\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-33-- **Logger**: `Abyss.Logger` - Structured logging with different levels\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-34-\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-242-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-243-## Security Features\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-244-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:245:### Rate Limiting\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:246:Abyss includes a token bucket rate limiter (`Abyss.RateLimiter`) for DoS protection:\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:247:- Per-IP rate limiting using token bucket algorithm\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-248-- Configurable packet limits and time windows\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:249:- Automatic cleanup of expired rate limit buckets\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:250:- Telemetry events for rate limit violations\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-251-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-252-### Packet Size Validation\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-253-Incoming packets are validated against `max_packet_size` to prevent memory exhaustion attacks.\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-362-### Supervisor Tree\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-363-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-364-Abyss (main supervisor)\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:365:├── Abyss.RateLimiter (if enabled) - Token bucket rate limiting\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-366-├── Abyss.ListenerPool (supervisor)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-367-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 1)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-368-│   ├── Abyss.Listener (listener process 2)\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-378-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-379-### Request Flow with Security\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-380-1. **Listener Pool**: Manages multiple listener processes for load distribution\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:381:2. **Listener**: Waits for UDP packets, applies rate limiting and packet size validation\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-382-3. **Connection**: Creates handler processes for valid packets with non-blocking retry logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-383-4. **Handler**: Processes packet data using user-defined logic\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-384-5. **Transport**: Handles low-level UDP socket operations\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:385:6. **Rate Limiter**: Enforces per-IP rate limits using token bucket algorithm\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-386-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-387-### Broadcast Mode\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-388-When `broadcast: true` is set:\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-418-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-419-## Key Implementation Details\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-420-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:421:### Rate Limiting Algorithm\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:422:The rate limiter uses a token bucket algorithm:\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-423-- Each IP address has a bucket with configurable token capacity\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-424-- Tokens are refilled at a constant rate based on time elapsed\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-425-- Packets consume tokens; requests are rejected when bucket is empty\n--\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-519-2. **Permission denied**: Avoid privileged ports (< 1024) or run with sudo\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-520-3. **Handler crashes**: Check that handler modules implement required callbacks\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-521-4. **Connection limits**: Adjust `num_connections` if hitting max connections\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:522:5. **Rate limiting**: Monitor telemetry events for rate limit violations\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-523-6. **Packet size**: Check `max_packet_size` configuration if packets are rejected\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-524-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-525-### Debugging Commands\n--\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-533-# Check connection supervisor status\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-534-# In IEx: Abyss.Server.connection_sup_pid(pid)\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-535-\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:536:# Monitor rate limiter statistics\napps/abyss/CLAUDE.md:537:# In IEx: Abyss.RateLimiter.get_stats()\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-538-```\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-539-\n/home/gao/Workspace/gsmlg-dev/yellow-dog/apps/abyss/CLAUDE.md-540-### Performance Tuning","numLines":90}}
