(80c73c1)\n    69→  - ACL evaluation in DISCOVER handling (allow/deny/custom_options)\n    70→  - ConflictResolver integration in DECLINE handling\n    71→  - CustomOptions template substitution in responses\n    72→- [x] Added handler integration tests (68c77b3)\n    73→  - DECLINE triggers ConflictResolver\n    74→  - IP quarantine verification\n    75→  - Conflict stats tracking\n    76→- [x] Fixed format_mac to handle 16-byte chaddr field\n    77→- [x] All 105 DHCPv4 tests pass, 1314 tests across all apps\n    78→\n    79→### Completed (Iteration 4 - Test Quality)\n    80→- [x] Reduced test log noise from expected error behaviors\n    81→  - DNS zone auth: Changed to debug level for \"No zone file path configured\"\n    82→  - ZoneService: Added suppress function for expected save errors\n    83→  - Added `@tag :capture_log` to tests that intentionally trigger errors:\n    84→    - `conflict_resolver_test.exs` - conflict handling tests\n    85→    - `handler_test.exs` (DHCPv4) - DECLINE handling tests\n    86→    - `handler_test.exs` (DNS) - error handling tests\n    87→    - `config_test.exs` - missing file and malformed TOML tests\n    88→    - `integration_test.exs` - error recovery tests\n    89→    - `config_manager_test.exs` - file not found tests\n    90→    - `settings_live_test.exs` - missing configuration tests\n    91→- [x] All 335+ tests pass with clean output (96c582d)\n    92→\n    93→### Completed (Iteration 5 - Security: Web Console Authentication)\n    94→- [x] Created `YellowDog.Console.Plugs.BasicAuth` module (b32bbd7)\n    95→  - Environment-based configuration (CONSOLE_USERNAME, CONSOLE_PASSWORD)\n    96→  - Constant-time string comparison to prevent timing attacks\n    97→  - Graceful degradation when password not configured (with warning log)\n    98→  - Configurable realm for WWW-Authenticate header\n    99→- [x] Added plug to browser pipeline in router.ex\n   100→- [x] Configured authentication per environment:\n   101→  - Disabled by de